#AREA Order's Domain~

#AUTHORS Picard~

#RANGES 65 95 35 99

#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT|AFLAG_NORIP|AFLAG_NOCASTLE

#TEMPERATURE 20 80 15 5

#HELPS
-1 ORDERS_DOMAIN_CHANGES~
03.22.09 - Fixed an issue where a char giving the wrong plans (Quarterstaff or Corer)
           to Jonathan or the Baker would cause the char to lose the plans.  The
           plans will now be returned to the player along with a narrative explaining
           the error.  (Order)
~
0 DOMAIN_REVISION~
Revision 2.95.I of Order's Domain 3/18/1999
~
0 DOMAIN 'ORDER'S DOMAIN'~
The Domain of Order is an earthy realm of the God Order.  No one seems to know
how this sacred place could be reached, as the last time a mortal set foot
there from this realm was close to 400 years ago.  Bards still sing of the
greatness of the masters that teach there, as Lord Order searched the realm
far and wide to select those to teach His arts.

   (A) Storyline
   (B) Quests
   (C) Equipment
   (D) Credits


{d}DOM_CREDITS
{c}DOM_EQU
{b}DOM_QUEST
{a}DOM_STORY
~
-1 DOM_STORY~
Domain was founded as a sanctuary for all Order followers.  Here they could
become closer to their god, as well as learn more about the religion they
have chosen.  Unfortunately, during the massive upheaval of the Chaos/Order
wars which nearly destroyed Chakkor, all contact seemed to have been lost with
the Realm.  Some still maintain that the secret entrance can be found in the
ancient songs of the bards, but most feel this is idle speculation.

(-) Back to Domain help

{-}DOMAIN
~
-1 DOM_QUEST~
The quests in Domain are fairly straight forward.  Of course, that doesn't
mean you should be able to do them without any thinking.  I don't have any
signs blaring out "This is a quest.  Say this in order to start", and most
are set up not to even hint themselves until you have fully explored the
area.  So if you wish to try any quests here, I'd recommend looking around
first.  And remember, Chaos that go there will be needing a doctor....sorely.

(-) Back to Domain help

{-}DOMAIN
~
-1 DOM_EQU~
The Masters that Order selected to teach his Sacred Arts are known to have the
strongest power in all the land.  Each has something they can teach those
willing to listen.  In addition, the Lord will probably reward his loyal
servants, and punish those whom soil his Realm.

(-) Back to Domain help

{-}DOMAIN
~
-1 DOM_CPRT~
This area copywritten under intellectual property rights.  It may be modified,
as long as the changes are reported under DOM_CHANGES.  Although changes do
not require the specific written consent of the author, it would be 'nice' to
do so.
~
-1 DOM_CHANGES~
08.29.98 - Domain completed and readied for implementation.
01.01.99 - Domain revision and corrections made:  Fixed item bugs
02.22.99 - Itty bitty bugs squashed.  Cockroach soup made.
12.20.04 - All mobprogs treat Demise and Chaos followers equally. (Mag)
12.20.04 - Removed class specific code from all equip. (Mag)
12.20.04 - Removed code from gypsy that allowed him to change equip type. (Mag)
12.20.04 - Fixed 155 spelling/grammar errors. (Mag)
12.20.04 - Confirmed all mpjunk used mpjunk i##### format. (Mag)
~
-1 DOM_CREDITS~
This area is originally from Hupsterman, written in 1995.  I (Picard) was
asked to bring it into MR readiness some time in 1997.  It took about a year
for me to learn how to code the correct way (*laugh*, shaddyap Jax!), and in
the process of designing it I decided to junk the whole area and build it from
scratch.  A bit of time was lost there, but I had a detailed map now available.

Thanks go out to Hupsterman for getting me started in coding this, to of
course the real Lord Order for inspiration, Lord Chaos for his time on
improving the Mud, Lovely Lady Maytrim for her complete understanding of
listening to me whine, my Clan Subang for listening to me whine (notice a
pattern of whining here?), and all others for their help and ideas.

Thanks all, and enjoy.

Picard, August 29th, 1998.

(-) Back to Domain help

{-}DOMAIN
~

0 $~


#MOBILES
#13800
servant~
a Servant to Order~
A Servant to Order wanders through the halls.~
The Servant is small and weak.~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
100 S
35 BODY_EYE BODY_ARM 1d1+3000 1d3+25
20000 144081
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 100~
rescale 13800 $n 100
if whichgod($n)==0
  say Welcome $n, may your stay here be fulfilling.
else
  if whichgod($n)==1
    say Welcome brother $n,  May Order guide us well.
    rescale 13800 $n 110
  else
    if whichgod($n)==2
      shout Help Guards!! Chaos scum is invading our domain!
    else
      if whichgod($n)==3
        shout Help Guards!! Demise scum is invading our domain!
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>fight_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)>1
  if rand(25)
    say The false god shall perish under the might of Order!
    mpquiet on
    cast 'acid blast'
    cast 'energy drain'
    mpquiet off
    say You are going to die.
  endif
  if rand(10)
    cast 'faerie fire' $n
  endif
  if rand(30)
    mpmload 13801
    mpforce $n say I will overcome Order
  endif
endif
~
|
#13801
guard~
A Domain guard~
A Guard of Orders Domain stands here quietly.~
The Guard is very strong, and is covered from head to toe in armor.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HUNT|AFF_TONGUES
500 S
160 BODY_ARM|BODY_HAND BODY_LEG|BODY_HAND 1d1+18000 15d12+55
200000 RACE_ELF
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)==2
  shout There is Chaos filth in our midst! Intruder!!
else
  if whichgod($n)==3
    shout There is Demise filth in our midst! Intruder!!
  else
    bow $n
    mpecho $I quietly steps back into the shadows.
    mppurge self
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog p I will overcome Order~
cackle $n
say I don't THINK SO!
shout GUARDS!!!! I have cornered the scum!!! Join me in the fight!
grin $n
say $n, you are toast!
mpkill $n
~
>fight_prog 70~
cast 'acid blast'
cast 'cure critical'
if whichgod($n)>1
  say You will die for your false god!
  mpecho A large ball of energy builds up in the guards palms.
  mpquiet on
  cast energy $n
  cast energy $n
  mpquiet off
  mpecho The guard utters the words, 'lepsid soahc'
  mpechoat $n You feel completely drained from the guards spell!
  mpechoaround $n is visibly drained, while the guard grows stronger!
else
  if whichgod($n)==1
    say Why are you doing this!
    pout $n
    say $n I am on your side!  Order is OUR god!
    say Why $n!?
  endif
endif
if rand(30)
  say You should not be here!
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
mpecho $I seems startled at the gaping wound your blade just dug.
look $n
say I and my brethren will remember your sin.
mpecho $I coughs and gasps for air as his body slumps down.
~
|
