cleric~
A cleric of Order~
A cleric is here offering himself to Order.~
He appears to be incredibly happy.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_SANCTUARY|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
300 S
50 BODY_MOUTH BODY_HAND|BODY_FOOT 1d1+5000 5d5+30
70133 269671
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>speech_prog donation gift~
say Yes, a small tax deductible gift can have a wondrous
say effect on your spiritual life......
grin 
~
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)>1
  shout GUARDS!!! Scum have entered our sanctuary!
  mpforce $n say I will overcome Order
else
  if whichgod($n) < 2
    say Welcome $n,
    say $n, do you have any of your worldly possession to offer unto your god?  The clerics are close to Order.
    if actorhasobjnum(13918)
      say A Fellow NSE! Please, take this item for the good of the Empire!
      mpoload 13855
      give i13855 $n
    endif
  endif
endif
mpmset self quest 1 5 1
rest 
mpecho The Cleric throws himself on the ground.
~
>fight_prog 99~
if rand(75)
  say The guards don't like me!  They wont help me.
  cast "cure critical"
endif
if rand(1)
  mpmload 13801
  mpforce $n say I will overcome Order
endif
~
>bribe_prog 2500000~
say Your offering is appreciated.  I shall make you young again...
say Good believers are always rewarded in Order.
mpmset $n quest 2 1 0
mpmset $n quest 3 1 0
mpmset $n quest 4 1 0
mpmset $n quest 5 1 0
mpmset $n quest 6 1 0
mpmset $n quest 7 1 0
mpmset $n quest 8 1 0
~
>rand_prog 75~
if quest(1,5,self) == 1
  say Oh Holy father of Reason... Take my offering.
  mpmadd self quest 1 5 1
  break
endif
if quest(1,5,self) == 2
  say Oh Holy father of Reason... Make me pure!
  mpmadd self quest 1 5 1
  break
endif
if quest(1,5,self) == 3
  mpecho The cleric starts wailing louder.
  mpmadd self quest 1 5 1
  break
endif
if quest(1,5,self) == 4
  say Oh Holy father of Reason... I offer myself unto thee!
  mpmadd self quest 1 5 1
  break
endif
if quest(1,5,self) == 5
  mpecho The Holy cleric kisses the ground.
  mpmadd self quest 1 5 1
  break
endif
if quest(1,5,self) == 6
  stand 
  say Lord Order is most gracious.
  mpmset self quest 1 5 0
  break
endif
~
|
