#13811
cleric master~
The cleric master~
A powerful cleric rests upon a throwing mat.~
Incredibly strong and more powerful than any other cleric you have ever met,
this man silently eyes you.  A small, flimsy robe covers his muscular torso.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_TRAIN|ACT_PRACTICE|ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
200 S
90 BODY_HAND BODY_HEAD|BODY_HAND 1d1+7000 11d6+30
291482 RACE_ORC
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)==1
  bow $n
else
  if whichgod($n)>1
    say Fiend!  How dare you show your hide here!
    say You will meet your maker $n.
    mpforce $n say I shall overcome Order
  endif
endif
mpquiet on
remove all
wear all
mpquiet off
~
>speech_prog p north wall~
if quest(11,2,$n) == 1
  mpecho $I looks around nervously.
  tell $n What do you know about that???
  tell $n If you think you can best me, try it.
  growl $n
  mpmset $n quest 11 2 2
else
  grin $n
  say Care to test the mat?
endif
~
>fight_prog 80~
if rand(80)
  cast harm
  cast heal
  say You will pay for your deceit $n!!
endif
~
>rand_prog 5~
cast sanctuary
cast 'enhanced heal'
~
>death_prog 100~
if quest(11,2,$n) == 2
  mpoload 13819
  give i13819 $n
  drop i13819
  say You are a good warrior!
  mpmset $n quest 11 2 3
endif
~
>rand_prog 3~
mpquiet on
remove all
if hasobjnum(13808)
else  
  if hasobjnum(13807)
    mpoload 13808
  else
    if hasobjnum(13806)
      mpoload 13807
    else
      if hasobjnum(13805)
        mpoload 13806
      else
        if hasobjnum(13804)
          mpoload 13805
        else
          if hasobjnum(13803)
            mpoload 13804
          else
            if hasobjnum(13802)
              mpoload 13803
            else
              if hasobjnum(13801)
                mpoload 13802
              else
                if hasobjnum(13800)
                  mpoload 13801
                else
                  mpoload 13800
                endif
              endif
            endif
          endif
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
wear all
mpquiet off
~
|
#13816
Gargoyle~
A gargoyle~
An evil looking gargoyle stands before you.~
This gargoyle looks like the one you fought with a long time ago in the tower.
Now, however, he's a little bit bigger......~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER
AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
0 S
95 0 0 1d1+8000 30d2+30
360037 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_NEUTRAL
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)>1
  shout GUARDS!!!! Help me slaughter $n as the blaspheming scum walks!
  break
endif
if whichgod($n)==1
  rescale 13816 $n 150
else
if quest(0,2,$n) == 1
  rescale 13816 $n 105
  glare 
else
  if quest(0,2,$n) == 2
    rescale 13816 $n 115
    cackle 
  else
    if quest(0,2,$n) == 3
      rescale 13816 $n 125
      drool 
    else
      rescale 13816 $n 100
      yawn 
    endif
  endif
endif
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
gasp 
look $n
smile $n
say You will reincarnate someday.....and I'll be waiting.....
if rand(10)
  mpmload 13816
  say But why not start NOW!!!!
  mpforce 2.gargoyle mpkill $n
endif
~
|
