#13860
ethereal spirit of chaos slaying~
An ethereal spirit of chaos slaying~
An ethereal spirit of chaos slaying.~
You only wish you could see this~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_NO_ORDER|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_DETECT_HIDDEN|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES|AFF_ETHEREAL
0 S
1 0 BODY_HEAD|BODY_HAND 1d1+8000 11d6+40
291482 780605
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if whichgod($n)>1
  mpareaecho $n is summoned to be executed for following the false lord!!!
  mptransfer $n 13862
  mpat 13862 mpforce $n say I will overcome Order
endif
if actorhasobjnum(11322)
   if quest(22,2,$n) > 0
      mpmset $n quest 22 2 0
   endif
else
   if quest(22,2,$n) > 1
      mpechoat $n You were warned once, warned again, and still have not learned.
      mpechoat $n I do not appreciate your constant cheating; now pay the penalty.
      slaughter $n
      break
   endif
   if quest(22,2,$n) == 0
      mpechoat $n You have not done the proper quests.... and should not be here.
      mpechoat $n Do not attempt to enter the Domain having cheated.
      mpmset $n quest 22 2 1
      mptransfer $n 9755
      break
   endif
   if quest(22,2,$n) == 1
      mpechoat $n You were warned once, yet have not learned.
      mpechoat $n Do not attempt to enter the Domain, having cheated the quests.
      mpechoat $n This is your last warning.
      mpmset $n quest 22 2 2
      slay $n
      break
   endif
endif
~
