#OBJECTS
#13800
white cloth robe CLASS_EQU_AC~
a white cloth robe~
A pile of white cloth lies here in a heap.~
Although this cloth feels flimsy, it has been infused with the magical powers
of Lord Order, and crafted by his guildsmen.~
ITEM_TYPE_ARMOR
ITEM_FLAG_AUTO_ENGRAVE|ITEM_FLAG_GLOW|ITEM_FLAG_MAGIC|ITEM_FLAG_ANTI_EVIL|ITEM_FLAG_LEVEL
ITEM_WEAR_TAKE|ITEM_WEAR_ABOUT
16 0 0 0
3 30000 63
A
APPLY_DEX 1
P 1
TRIG_DAMAGE 15
OPROG_IF OIF_USER_PERCENT_HITPT < 100 2 0
P 2
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_IF OIF_WEAR_LOC ! WEAR_NONE 3 0
P 3
TRIG_VOID
OPROG_APPLY OAPPLY_HIT 30


