#13852
The Altar~
The blinding white light fills this room bathing everything in a brilliant
glow.  There can be seen a ghastly chaos follower tied spread-eagle and upside
down to an altar of Order here.  The chaos follower struggles meekly at his
bonds, the light and the power of reason too great for his wretched mind.
A small cup collects the blood dripping from the many hideous wounds, which is
then fed into the fountain, feeding it's nourishing strength.~
