"Bellissimae".  You are tempted to touch one, to see if indeed it is really a
fruit, or, if it is as pure gold as it appears to be.  Rumors of their
sweetness and taste have traveled even to Chakkor, where they are prized as
delicacies for several prominent citizens who guard the fountains.~
