#13982
Monk Guild~
You walk into a brightly lit room, floor covered with mats. The walls are bare 
of all ornament, heavily racked with weaponry of all possible types. Just as you 
pause to wonder why so many weapons are in a place of unarmed combat your legs 
are swept out from under you. You land on your back, gaping up in surprise at 
the wrinkled visage smiling benignly down at you. He winks. The tiny ancient man 
holds out a hand and helps you rise. The monk Master says, 'Order and Balance, 
Balance and Order.'~
138 ROOM_NO_CASTLE|ROOM_NO_RIP SECT_INSIDE
DDIR_EAST
More of the Glorified Guildsmen~
~
